{"availability":"available","full":"Wan-Video/Wan-Animate-2","name":"Wan-Animate-2","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":348,"forks":35,"created":"2026-07-13T08:42:16Z","updated":"2026-08-08T06:27:43Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://www.modelscope.cn/studios/Wan-AI/Wan2.2-Animate","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:12.417Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:12.417Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:12.417Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T04:29:35.412Z","stars":338,"forks":33},{"at":"2026-10-17T02:58:12.417Z","stars":348,"forks":35}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Guangyuan Wang^∗^, Li Hu^†^, Dechao Meng^∗^, Zhongyi Zhang^∗^, Peng Zhang^∗^, Xindi Zhang^∗^, Mingyang Huang, Ruoshi Zhang, Ke Sun, Zhe Zhang, Xingjun Wang, Gang Cheng, Hai Xu, Bang Zhang^‡^","We present Wan-Animate-2, a novel end-to-end character animation framework that directly consumes driving videos in a redesigned Diffusion Transformer, which achieves high-fidelity motion generation and strong identity preservation by eliminating intermediate motion extractors. We further add text-driven viewpoint control to decouple the output camera perspective from the driving video. In addition, we develop Wan-Animate-2-Lite, an efficient variant that reduces inference latency to real-time thresholds for streaming character animation."],"features":["August 07, 2026: 🎉 We release the Wan-Animate-2 inference scripts.","August 07, 2026: 🎉 We release the Wan-Animate-2 Base model weights.","August 07, 2026: 🎉 We release the Wan-Animate-2 Distillation model weights."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Wan-Video/Wan-Animate-2/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"90ba2d1fbe516ac38286ce0aec527dc20db5dcbc83d39a6d0fec2caf23e775a3","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:35.575Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:35.575Z","projectInsight